    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108678" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπόλειψις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>failure, deficiency,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ θερμοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Placit.</u>
					5.30.4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ὀδόντων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>GA</u>
					745a33
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>falling behind,</i> in growth, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				5.1.11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> Astron . .
				<i>direct motion,</i> i. e. Eastwards along the ecliptic,
				<i><span class="en">
				Gem.
				12.19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ptol.
				<u>Alm.</u>
				1.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				12.1
			</span></i>, Theo Sm.<i><span class="en">
				p.147
			</span></i> H. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>occultation,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>VP</u>
				6.31
			</span></i>.</div>
